    <description>Screen Flow version of the Controlled Document PDF Agent. On a Controlled Document: compare a new PDF with its Primary Content (version check, then what changed), or create a new document. Elsewhere: create a Draft Controlled Document from a PDF, with the fields read from the PDF for the user to accept, edit or clear.</description>
